["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">屋上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">屋顶；楼顶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202146\">デパートの<ruby>屋上<rp>(</rp><rt>おくじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にアドバルーンが<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">公寓的天花板上有一个Advaron。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">贈り物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくりもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">礼物；赠礼；礼品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161289\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はおじによい<ruby>贈<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもらった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我给了叔叔一个好礼物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">送る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">发送；邮寄；转发；传送；运送；汇款；送行；护送；陪同；带领；送别（逝者）；与逝者告别；安葬；度过；消磨；过（生活）；生活；传递；推进（跑垒员）；添加送假名</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149101\"><ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってもらえませんか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把我送到车里吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遅れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迟到；延误；落后于日程；落后；滞后；跟不上时代；（亲人）先逝；失去（亲人）；（钟表）走慢</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124786\"><ruby>電車<rp>(</rp><rt>でんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はほとんど<ruby>一時間<rp>(</rp><rt>いちじかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火车迟到了一个小时。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">起す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おこす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抬起；举起；竖起；拾起；唤醒；叫醒；弄醒；引起；导致；造成；触发；产生（如热、电等）；引发；开始；启动；创办；建立；开设；开张；耕；犁；耕耘；患上；得（病）；誊写；记录（口述内容）；翻动（卡牌）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">行う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おこなう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">进行；执行；实施</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229318\">いう<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>おこな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったく<ruby>別<rp>(</rp><rt>べつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">做事和做事是完全不同的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怒る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おこる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生气；发怒；发脾气；责骂；训斥；批评</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204653\">それをそのままにしておきなさい。そうしないと<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">保持它,否则你会生气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">押し入れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おしいれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">壁橱；衣柜；推拉门柜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180480\"><ruby>強盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>押<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れに<ruby>閉<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">抢劫者把孩子抓住了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">教える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おしえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">教；告诉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">教</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お嬢さん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おじょうさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（他人的）女儿；年轻女性；小姐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227017\">お<ruby>嬢<rp>(</rp><rt>じょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合格<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なさったそうですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她说她已经通过了考试。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お宅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">你的家；你的住处；你的家族；你的丈夫；你的机构；贵机构；你</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179923\"><ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いうちにお<ruby>宅<rp>(</rp><rt>たく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にうかがいます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我很快就回家了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">落ちる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おちる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">落下；坠落；下降；倒塌；塌陷；崩塌；（日月）西沉；落下；下沉；（知名度、质量、速度、销售等）下降；衰落；下跌；衰退；恶化；减弱；不如；不及；逊于；差于；（污垢、油漆、妆等）脱落；（污渍）消除；（颜色）褪去；（疾病、附身等）消除；（多余脂肪）减掉；变瘦；变精瘦；遗漏；省略；缺失；（考试）不及格；（竞赛、选举等）落选；失败；（道德、品格等）堕落；变得低俗；沦落；堕入；没落；垮掉；毁灭；堕入（地狱）；陷入（爱河、睡眠等）；落入（某人手中）；（出价）被接受；（招标）中标；（汇票）被兑现；落入（陷阱）；上（当）；屈服；让步；认罪；招供；坦白；（最终）归结到（结论、话题等）；落在……上；弃守；逃离（城镇、城堡等）；战败逃亡；（话）听进去；心里接受；领会；陷落；战败；（金钱）进账；（光线、影子、目光等）落在……上；照到；投在；（柔道）被绞昏；失去知觉；昏迷；（网站、服务器等）宕机；崩溃；（网络游戏、聊天室等）登出；退出；离线；（鱼在冬天）游向深水；（动物）死亡；（闪电）击中</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83323\"><ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しないと<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちるよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果不学习,我会去考试。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おっしゃる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">说；讲；告诉；被称为；名叫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"2912698\"><ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くおっしゃる<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你说的完全是对的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おっと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">丈夫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84999\"><ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>おっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつもベッドで<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むんです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">夫人在床上常常读书。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おつり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">找零；零钱；马桶溅水</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235837\">１ドルでおつりがありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你有1美元的钱吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">音</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">声音；噪音；音符；乐音；名声；名望</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224760\">ここから<ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>うみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>おと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们从这里可以听到海的声音。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/900647\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">落す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おとす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">掉落；遗失；放下；投射；倒入；留下；擦净；去除（污垢、妆容等）；失去；（在某处）花钱；省略；遗漏；暗中放走；输掉（比赛）；淘汰（应试者）；使不及格；（选举中）击败对手；降低；减少；恶化；贬低；看不起；陷入困境；陷入（困境、罪孽）；据为己有；中标；迫使投降；攻陷（敌阵、城池）；强行说服；逼供；处理；下载；复制；使其失去意识（柔道）；讲完；说出关键部分；结束（斋戒等一段时期）；赢得；引诱；克服</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">踊り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おどり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">舞蹈；跳舞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153219\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>踊<rp>(</rp><rt>おど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りが<ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我觉得她跳舞得很好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">踊る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おどる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">跳舞；舞蹈；被操纵；随人起舞；被人牵着鼻子走</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199153\">なぜ<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>踊<rp>(</rp><rt>おど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなかったの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你为什么不和他一起跳舞?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">驚く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おどろく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">惊讶；吃惊；惊奇；震惊；害怕；受惊；惊恐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83064\"><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのニュースを<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>驚<rp>(</rp><rt>おどろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">妈妈听到这个消息,很惊讶。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お祭り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おまつり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">节日；庆典；狂欢节；祭典</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お見舞い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おみまい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">探病；慰问；问候；慰问信；慰问函；祝愿康复的信；慰问品；击中；命中；打击</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お土産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おみやげ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旅游时买回来送人的当地特产；旅游纪念品；访客带来的伴手礼；来访者带来的礼物；在旅途中意外得到的不愉快之物（如染上的疾病）；令人不快的馈赠；帮了倒忙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218090\">これは<ruby>北海道<rp>(</rp><rt>ほっかいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からのお<ruby>土産<rp>(</rp><rt>みやげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是来自北海道的礼物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">思い出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもいだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">想起；回忆；回想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231433\">あなたを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るとお<ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>にい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんを<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看见你,我还记得哥哥。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">思う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">想；认为；相信；推测；想要做；打算做；判断；评估；认为；想象；假设；梦想；期待；盼望；感受；处于（某种心理状态）；渴望；想要；深切关心；渴望；担忧；热爱；回忆；记得</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143025\"><ruby>晴<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れだと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我认为它是清洁的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おもちゃ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">玩具；玩物；被当作玩物的人或物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231360\">あのおもちゃは<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玩具是由木材制成的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">表</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おもて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">表面；面；朝外可见的一面；正面；硬币正面；外部；外面；外观；样子；公开；公众；棒球比赛的上半局；局的上半部分；（榻榻米等的）席面；罩面；（计算机）前台；表千家（茶道流派）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221729\">この<ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどちらが<ruby>表<rp>(</rp><rt>おもて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だか<ruby>見分<rp>(</rp><rt>みわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けがつかない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这张纸上不清楚哪个是表。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">親</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">父母；双亲；（纸牌、麻将）庄家；坐庄者；创始人；发明人；（宠物）主人；饲主；核心的；母体（组织）；主要的；祖先；先祖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165585\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をあてにしてはいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们不应该放弃父母。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泳ぎ方</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">およぎかた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">游泳方式；泳姿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"178635\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>泳<rp>(</rp><rt>およ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎ<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我会教你如何游泳。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下りる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おりる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下降；下来；降下；下车；下船；下马；离开；下台；退职；放弃；退出；认输；获得；颁发；给予；形成；凝结（霜、露、雾等）；排出；排泄（蛔虫等寄生虫）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">折る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">折断；折裂；掰断；摘取（花等）；折叠；弯曲；折（折纸）；打断；结束</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210071\">その<ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>四<rp>(</rp><rt>よっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>折<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りにしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把这张纸切成四块。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お礼</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おれい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感谢；谢意；礼仪；礼节；鞠躬；报酬；礼物；仪式；礼仪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140082\"><ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>成<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わってお<ruby>礼<rp>(</rp><rt>れい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我为我的儿子向您致谢。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/10267403\" title=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">折れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">折断；断裂；骨折；被折叠；屈服；退让；让步；妥协；转弯；拐弯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190767\"><ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>折<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>あし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をついだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">医生抓住了他的骨折的脚。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">終わり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">结束；终结；完结；生命的终结；死亡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216951\">さぁ、<ruby>一日<rp>(</rp><rt>いちにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりとしましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">好吧,让我们结束一天。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">終わる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">结束</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">終</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">オートバイ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摩托车；机动两轮车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227779\">オートバイに<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのは<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">骑自行车很开心。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海岸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいがん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海岸；海滨；滨海；海边；沙滩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185047\"><ruby>海岸<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはほとんど<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海岸上几乎没有人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会議</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">会议；集会；大会；理事会；代表大会；国会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185354\"><ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりに<ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>づきつつあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">会议接近尾声。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098524\" title=\"Tatoeba · jan_OkulaJu\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jan_OkulaJu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会議室</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいぎしつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">会议室</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">室</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開始</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">开始（名词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">始</a></span></div></li>"]